      "url": "https://www.morningagclips.com/dairys-foundation-grant-applications-open-until-dec-1/",
      "title": "[morningagclips.com] Farm grant programs offer funding with deadlines through January 2027",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=www.morningagclips.com&amp;sz=128\" style=\"width:100%;max-height:300px;object-fit:cover;\"/>\nApplications are open for agricultural grants supporting soil-health projects in Maryland, farm resilience in Vermont, dairy education across the United States, and small farms and specialty crops in Romania. Deadlines range from Nov. 16 to Jan. 8, 2027; awards include up to $50,000 for Maryland soil projects and up to $10,000 for dairy education initiatives.\n\nRomania’s small-farm program has €93.3 million available, while about €5 million remains for investments in floriculture and medicinal and aromatic plants; both application windows close Nov. 16. Vermont’s NOFA-VT resilience grant program accepts applications through Dec. 15, and Dairy’s Foundation is taking applications through Dec. 1.",
